OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with occasionally heavy
OL,8,Fshowers or longer spells of rain at
OL,9,Ftimes and a few patches of haar.
OL,10,FIsolated risk of thunder.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FHaar and occasionally heavy
OL,13,Frain soon clears east. Then rather
OL,14,Fcloudy with scattered showers and just
OL,15,Fa few brighter interludes.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
